---
subject: {{websiteName}} — Activate your e-mail
preheader: Confirm your e-mail address to finish signing up
buttonLabel: Activate e-mail
buttonUrl: {{activationLink}}
footer: This link expires in {{expiresInMinutes}} minutes. If you didn't create an account, you can safely ignore this e-mail.
---
<h2>Activate your account</h2>
<p>Hello <strong>{{username}}</strong>,</p>
<p>Thanks for signing up! Click the button below to confirm <strong>{{email}}</strong> and activate your account.</p>
{{#if activationCode}}
<p>Or enter this activation code:</p>
<p><code>{{activationCode}}</code></p>
{{/if}}
